 "remarks": "Welcome Home to this Town Line Center townhouse which offers loft living at its finest! The vaulted ceilings and skylight offers an abundance of natural light into the space. The main floor features a coat closet, a storage closet that can be used as a pantry, kitchen with a breakfast bar and sight lines into the large living room, a half bath as well as the in unit stackable washer/dryer. The upper level is home to the primary bedroom, a full bath, and an oversized walk-in closet with plenty of space for a home office. While walkable to numerous shops and restaurants including a Panera Bread, the private balcony offers a chance to be at one with nature. Schedule your showing today to see this beautiful unit before it's sold!",
